<section class="px-6 py-24">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-header text-amber-bright text-sm tracking-widest mb-6">
      THE NIGHTLY RITUAL
    </h2>
    <pre class="font-ui text-amber-DEFAULT text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto">
&#10;  23:50 UTC  ──┐
                │  pg_cron fires
                ▼
        ┌──────────────────────┐
        │  daily-summary       │
        │   (Edge Function)    │
        │                      │
        │  aggregates the day  │
        │  → Llama 3.3 70B     │
        │  → diary entry       │
        └──────────────────────┘
                │
                ▼
        public.entries  ◀─── realtime: the app subscribes
                │
                ▼
   06:30 the next morning, you open MEMOIR_LOG and find
   a new page already written.
    </pre>

    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-amber-dim text-lg">
      &gt; no LLM hits the network at write time. every poll runs against
      its own free-tier quota; the narrator only fires once per day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
